    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "American\nAirlines\nAUGUST 1,1972\nQUICK REFERENCE SCHEDULE\nDayton, Ohio\nTHE SOUTHWEST \u0026 MEXICO\nVIA DALLAS\nDAYTON\nSAN FRANCISCO\nLOS ANGELES -\nSAN DIEGO\nPHOENIX\nTUCSON-\nEL PASO\nDALLAS\nHOUSTON\nSAN ANTONIO\nMEXICO CITY\nACAPULCO",
      "HIGHLIGHTS\nTO\nACAPULCO\nLEAVE (EDT)\n9:30 AM\n2:50 PM\nINTERNATIONAL PARADISE\nCocktails/Lunch\nCocktails/Dinner\nARRIVE (CST)\n2:15 PM\n9:26 PM\nTO\nBOSTON\nLEAVE (EDT)\n8:30 AM\n5:30 PM\nTWO THROUGH ASTROJETS\nBreakfast\nCocktails/Dinner\nARRIVE (EDT)\n11:14 AM\n8:19 PM\nTO\nDALLAS\nLEAVE (EDT)\n9:30 AM\n2:50 PM\n4:50 PM\nTHREE ASTROJETS\nCocktails/Snack\nCocktails/ Dinner\nARRIVE (CDT)\n11:27 AM\n4:44 PM\n6:40 PM\nTO\nMEXICO CITY\nLEAVE (EDT)\n9:30 AM\n2:50 PM\nASTROJET ALL THE WAY\nCocktails/Lunch\nCocktails/Dinner\nARRIVE (CST)\n1:50 PM\n7:44 PM\nTO\nNEW YORK\nLEAVE (EDT)\n8:30 AM\n5:30 PM\nNON-STOP ASTROJETS TO\nCONVENIENT LAGUARDIA\nBreakfast\nCocktails/Dinner\nARRIVE (EDT)\n9:56 AM\n6:59 AM\nTO\nPHOENIX\nTHE SUN \u0026 FUN COUNTRY\nLEAVE (EDT)\n9:30 AM\nCocktails/Lunch\n*2:50 PM\nCocktails/Dinner\n4:50 PM\nCocktails/Dinner\nARRIVE (MST)\n12:58 PM\n5:36 PM\n8:42 PM\n* Only through flight from Dayton.\nFOR RESERVATIONS CALL\n222-2592\nFROM OUTSIDE DAYTON AREA CALL TOLL FREE\n1-800-582-3933\nAmericanAirlines\nOur passengers get the best of everything.\n104-010\nPRINTED IN U.S.A."
